features.description:
Customize your vehicle’s tyre pressure monitoring setup to match your hardware configuration. With MBito, you can easily switch between different Mercedes systems: 
477 – Run Flat Indicator: calculates tyre pressure changes using ESP data with no direct pressure display in the cluster; 
475 – Inflation Pressure Control (High Line): displays actual tyre pressures and warnings, requiring factory pressure sensors in each wheel and receiver antennas in the car; 
470 – Inflation Pressure Control (Low Line): provides a basic pressure monitoring system;
Check your vehicle’s datacard for SA code 470/475/477. After selecting your preferred system, ensure your tyre pressures are correctly set and perform a pressure reset via the instrument cluster menu.

